{"citation_group_id":"283701ac8997b95dab53be82","citation_text":"6","confidence":1.0,"relation_type":"internal_reference","resolver":"internal_section","source_anchor":"^s-5dfac198e4d09fe7b479645d","source_etar_id":"3c362520d7a311e4894f9bde45468d3f","source_excerpt":"7. Vyriausybės įgaliota institucija gali uždrausti šio straipsnio 5 ir 6 dalyse nustatytą asmens ir turto saugą, jei ji keltų grėsmę visuomenės saugumui ar viešajai tvarkai.","source_link":"[[latest/3c362520d7a311e4894f9bde45468d3f#^s-5dfac198e4d09fe7b479645d|7 str. 7 dalis]]","source_path":"latest/3c362520d7a311e4894f9bde45468d3f.md","source_section_id":"5dfac198e4d09fe7b479645d","target_anchor":"^s-25ed262ccbdc6add2ea077d3","target_etar_id":"3c362520d7a311e4894f9bde45468d3f","target_link":"[[latest/3c362520d7a311e4894f9bde45468d3f#^s-25ed262ccbdc6add2ea077d3|7 str. 6 dalis]]","target_path":"latest/3c362520d7a311e4894f9bde45468d3f.md","target_section_id":"25ed262ccbdc6add2ea077d3"}
{"citation_group_id":"1ac13e1a523a27bcf7d1aea3","citation_text":"Šio straipsnio 1 dalyje","confidence":1.0,"relation_type":"internal_reference","resolver":"internal_section","source_anchor":"^s-60d79866f2586d53bbff7636","source_etar_id":"3c362520d7a311e4894f9bde45468d3f","source_excerpt":"3. Licencija ginkluotai asmens ir turto saugai suteikia teisę vykdyti ir neginkluotą asmens ir turto saugą. Šio straipsnio 1 dalyje nustatyta asmens ir turto sauga be licencijos yra draudžiama.","source_link":"[[latest/3c362520d7a311e4894f9bde45468d3f#^s-60d79866f2586d53bbff7636|7 str. 3 dalis]]","source_path":"latest/3c362520d7a311e4894f9bde45468d3f.md","source_section_id":"60d79866f2586d53bbff7636","target_anchor":"^s-39c684722eb5607cd7ec9f98","target_etar_id":"3c362520d7a311e4894f9bde45468d3f","target_link":"[[latest/3c362520d7a311e4894f9bde45468d3f#^s-39c684722eb5607cd7ec9f98|7 str. 1 dalis]]","target_path":"latest/3c362520d7a311e4894f9bde45468d3f.md","target_section_id":"39c684722eb5607cd7ec9f98"}
